    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "1",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "AMO 3:1"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "1",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Hear this word that the",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "AMO.3.1",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "AMO.3.1"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "char",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "nd"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "LORD",
              "type": "text",
              "attrs": {
                "verseId": "AMO.3.1",
                "verseOrgIds": [
                  "AMO.3.1"
                ]
              }
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "hath spoken against you, O children of Israel, against the whole family which I brought up from the land of Egypt, saying,",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "AMO.3.1",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "AMO.3.1"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "2",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "AMO 3:2"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "2",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "You only have I known of all the families of the earth: therefore I will punish you for all your iniquities.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "AMO.3.2",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "AMO.3.2"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "text": "",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "AMO.3.2",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "AMO.3.2"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "3",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "AMO 3:3"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "3",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Can two walk together, except they be agreed?",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "AMO.3.3",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "AMO.3.3"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "4",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "AMO 3:4"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "4",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Will a lion roar in the forest, when he hath no prey? will a young lion cry out of his den, if he have taken nothing?",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "AMO.3.4",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "AMO.3.4"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "text": "",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "AMO.3.4",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "AMO.3.4"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "5",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "AMO 3:5"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "5",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Can a bird fall in a snare upon the earth, where no gin",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "AMO.3.5",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "AMO.3.5"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "char",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "add"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "is",
              "type": "text",
              "attrs": {
                "verseId": "AMO.3.5",
                "verseOrgIds": [
                  "AMO.3.5"
                ]
              }
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "for him? shall",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "AMO.3.5",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "AMO.3.5"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "char",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "add"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "one",
              "type": "text",
              "attrs": {
                "verseId": "AMO.3.5",
                "verseOrgIds": [
                  "AMO.3.5"
                ]
              }
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "take up a snare from the earth, and have taken nothing at all?",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "AMO.3.5",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "AMO.3.5"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "6",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "AMO 3:6"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "6",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Shall a trumpet be blown in the city, and the people not be afraid? shall there be evil in a city, and the",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "AMO.3.6",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "AMO.3.6"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "char",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "nd"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "LORD",
              "type": "text",
              "attrs": {
                "verseId": "AMO.3.6",
                "verseOrgIds": [
                  "AMO.3.6"
                ]
              }
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "hath not done",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "AMO.3.6",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "AMO.3.6"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "char",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "add"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "it",
              "type": "text",
              "attrs": {
                "verseId": "AMO.3.6",
                "verseOrgIds": [
                  "AMO.3.6"
                ]
              }
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "?",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "AMO.3.6",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "AMO.3.6"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "text": "",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "AMO.3.6",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "AMO.3.6"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "7",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "AMO 3:7"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "7",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Surely the Lord",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "AMO.3.7",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "AMO.3.7"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "char",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "nd"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "GOD",
              "type": "text",
              "attrs": {
                "verseId": "AMO.3.7",
                "verseOrgIds": [
                  "AMO.3.7"
                ]
              }
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "will do nothing, but he revealeth his secret unto his servants the prophets.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "AMO.3.7",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "AMO.3.7"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "8",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "AMO 3:8"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "8",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "The lion hath roared, who will not fear? the Lord",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "AMO.3.8",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "AMO.3.8"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "char",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "nd"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "GOD",
              "type": "text",
              "attrs": {
                "verseId": "AMO.3.8",
                "verseOrgIds": [
                  "AMO.3.8"
                ]
              }
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "hath spoken, who can but prophesy?",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "AMO.3.8",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "AMO.3.8"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "9",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "AMO 3:9"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "9",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "¶ Publish in the palaces at Ashdod, and in the palaces in the land of Egypt, and say, Assemble yourselves upon the mountains of Samaria, and behold the great tumults in the midst thereof, and the oppressed in the midst thereof.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "AMO.3.9",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "AMO.3.9"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "text": "",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "AMO.3.9",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "AMO.3.9"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "10",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "AMO 3:10"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "10",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "For they know not to do right, saith the",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "AMO.3.10",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "AMO.3.10"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "char",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "nd"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "LORD",
              "type": "text",
              "attrs": {
                "verseId": "AMO.3.10",
                "verseOrgIds": [
                  "AMO.3.10"
                ]
              }
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": ", who store up violence and robbery in their palaces.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "AMO.3.10",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "AMO.3.10"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "text": "",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "AMO.3.10",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "AMO.3.10"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "11",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "AMO 3:11"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "11",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Therefore thus saith the Lord",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "AMO.3.11",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "AMO.3.11"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "char",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "nd"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "GOD",
              "type": "text",
              "attrs": {
                "verseId": "AMO.3.11",
                "verseOrgIds": [
                  "AMO.3.11"
                ]
              }
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "; An adversary",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "AMO.3.11",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "AMO.3.11"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "char",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "add"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "there shall be",
              "type": "text",
              "attrs": {
                "verseId": "AMO.3.11",
                "verseOrgIds": [
                  "AMO.3.11"
                ]
              }
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "even round about the land; and he shall bring down thy strength from thee, and thy palaces shall be spoiled.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "AMO.3.11",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "AMO.3.11"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "12",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "AMO 3:12"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "12",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Thus saith the",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "AMO.3.12",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "AMO.3.12"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "char",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "nd"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "LORD",
              "type": "text",
              "attrs": {
                "verseId": "AMO.3.12",
                "verseOrgIds": [
                  "AMO.3.12"
                ]
              }
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "; As the shepherd taketh out of the mouth of the lion two legs, or a piece of an ear; so shall the children of Israel be taken out that dwell in Samaria in the corner of a bed, and in Damascus",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "AMO.3.12",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "AMO.3.12"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "char",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "add"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "in",
              "type": "text",
              "attrs": {
                "verseId": "AMO.3.12",
                "verseOrgIds": [
                  "AMO.3.12"
                ]
              }
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "a couch.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "AMO.3.12",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "AMO.3.12"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "text": "",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "AMO.3.12",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "AMO.3.12"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "13",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "AMO 3:13"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "13",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Hear ye, and testify in the house of Jacob, saith the Lord",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "AMO.3.13",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "AMO.3.13"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "char",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "nd"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "GOD",
              "type": "text",
              "attrs": {
                "verseId": "AMO.3.13",
                "verseOrgIds": [
                  "AMO.3.13"
                ]
              }
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": ", the God of hosts,",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "AMO.3.13",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "AMO.3.13"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "14",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "AMO 3:14"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "14",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "That in the day that I shall visit the transgressions of Israel upon him I will also visit the altars of Beth-el: and the horns of the altar shall be cut off, and fall to the ground.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "AMO.3.14",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "AMO.3.14"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "text": "",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "AMO.3.14",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "AMO.3.14"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "15",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "AMO 3:15"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "15",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "And I will smite the winter house with the summer house; and the houses of ivory shall perish, and the great houses shall have an end, saith the",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "AMO.3.15",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "AMO.3.15"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "char",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "nd"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "LORD",
              "type": "text",
              "attrs": {
                "verseId": "AMO.3.15",
                "verseOrgIds": [
                  "AMO.3.15"
                ]
              }
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": ".",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "AMO.3.15",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "AMO.3.15"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    }
